                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for sarah &amp;lt;sarah@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/af0f65f4-f94d-11e4-b150-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/af0f65f4-f94d-11e4-b150-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_54 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;request on 0x400000401:0x1bd:0x0 is not FAILED on mds1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: shadow-21vm8 /usr/sbin/lctl get_param -n mdt.lustre-MDT0000.hsm.actions | awk '/'0x400000401:0x1bd:0x0'.*action='ARCHIVE'/ {print \$13}' | cut -f2 -d=
Update not seen after 200s: wanted 'FAILED' got ''
 sanity-hsm test_54: @@@@@@ FAIL: request on 0x400000401:0x1bd:0x0 is not FAILED on mds1 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
